Type: shiny
Title: Clinical Trial Data Quality & AI Review Dashboard
Version: 1.0.0
Description: RShiny dashboard for automated clinical trial data review, quality
    monitoring, and AI-powered data exploration. Built with CDISC SDTM-compliant
    synthetic data for a medical device surgical trial.
Depends:
    shiny,
    shinydashboard,
    plotly,
    DT,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    readr,
    lubridate,
    stringr,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    ggplot2,
    scales
